{
 "name": "pf-mod-firearms-pistols",
 "about": "mod-firearms-pistols against the built package firearms instead of the mods' source folders (tools/make_package_scenarios.py). One pistol for either hand: two pistols picked up and clicked in the bag go to the main hand and then the off hand (the off-hand twin); Reload's cast shows the reloading icon; holding the trigger through a reload says nothing, a fresh click while reloading warns once. Unequipped, the off-hand pistol is a main-hand pistol in the bag again, and goes back on the off hand.",
